  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx = frac{{2 + sqrt 3 }}{{2 - sqrt 3 }}\n\n**Concept used:**\n\nConcept of Rationalisation\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nx = frac{{2 + √ 3 }}{{2 - √ 3 }}\n\n⇒ x = frac{{(2 + √ 3)(2 + √ 3) }}{{(2 - √ 3)(2 + √ 3)}}\n\n⇒ x = frac{{(2 + √ 3)² }}{{2² - (√ 3)²}}\n\n⇒ x = frac{{(2 + √ 3)² }}{{4 - 3}}\n\n⇒ x = {{(2 + √ 3)² }}\n\n⇒ x = 2² + √3² + 2 × 2 × √3\n\n⇒ x = 4 + 3 + 4√3 = 7 + 4√3\n\n(x - 7)2\n\n⇒ (7 + 4√3 - 7)²\n\n⇒ (4√3)2\n\n⇒ 48\n\n**∴ Required answer is 48**\n\n212:Taf6,",
